{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-129-1","title":"Psalms 129:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":129,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":129,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 An exhortation to praise God for saving Israel in their great afflictions. 5 The haters of the church are cursed.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3470. B.C. 534. (Title.) A Song of degrees.This Psalm was most probably composed in consequence of the opposition of the Samaritans.</p>\n<p>Ezr 4:1-23 Ps 120:1; 121:1; 122:1; 123:1; 124:1; 125:1; 126:1; 127:1; *titles 128:1; *title Many. or, Much. have they. Ex 1:12-14,22; 5:7-19; Jud 2:15; 10:8-12; 1Sa 13:19; La 1:3 from. Jer 2:2; Eze 23:3; Ho 2:15; 11:1 may. 124:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-129-2","title":"Psalms 129:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":129,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":129,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>yet they have. 34:19; 118:13; 125:1; Job 5:19; Mt 16:18; Ro 8:35-39; Joh 16:33 Re 12:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-129-3","title":"Psalms 129:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":129,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":129,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>The plowers. 141:7; Isa 51:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-129-4","title":"Psalms 129:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":129,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":129,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>The Lord. Ezr 9:15; Ne 9:33; La 1:18; 3:22; Da 9:7 cut asunder. 124:6,7; 140:5-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-129-5","title":"Psalms 129:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":129,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":129,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>be confounded. 83:4-11; 122:6; Es 6:13; 9:5; Isa 10:12; 37:22,28,29,35 Zec 1:14-17; 12:3,6; 1Co 16:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-129-6","title":"Psalms 129:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":129,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":129,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>as the grass. 37:2; 92:7; Jer 17:5,6; Mt 13:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-129-7","title":"Psalms 129:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":129,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":129,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>he that bindeth. 126:6; Isa 17:10,11; Ho 8:7; Ga 6:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-129-8","title":"Psalms 129:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":129,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":129,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>The blessing. 118:26; Ru 2:4</p>"}]}